---
title: Sales by region
params:
  region: "east"
  since: "2026-01-01"
capabilities:
  fs: "read"
  net: false
---

# Sales by region

Revenue for **${region}** since ${since}: ${fmt_money(total)}.

```olang {name: load}
let sales = unwrap(ods.read_csv_file("data/sales.csv"))
```

```olang
let mine = sales |> ods.filter(sales["region"] == region)
let total = ods.sum(mine["amount"])
println(`${region} since ${since}: ${total}`)
```

```olang {name: chart, hide: code}
let chart = plot.bar(mine["month"], mine["amount"], #{ "title": "Sales" })
println(len(chart) > 0)
```
